  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41718160",
      "title": "Throwing Not Found Errors For Individual Meals",
      "sourceHash": "37c742066c2289dcfe28b2624e0ceb4fe133ae5734938a1bfc2b29113d32be9f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.93,
          "end": 2.1,
          "en": "Now, it is possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 6.21,
          "en": "that a user tries to look for a meal that doesn't exist,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.21,
          "end": 8.433,
          "en": "like great bolo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.72,
          "end": 12.933,
          "en": "And in that case, I get this \"An error occurred\" page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.1,
          "end": 16.74,
          "en": "Now, I'm getting this error-occurred page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.74,
          "end": 21.63,
          "en": "because I'm trying to access the instructions on undefined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.63,
          "end": 24.693,
          "en": "because I wasn't able to load a meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.65,
          "end": 28.11,
          "en": "So it's good that we get some fallback page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.11,
          "end": 31.32,
          "en": "but it's not actually an error that occurred,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.32,
          "end": 33.87,
          "en": "if we look at it from a technical perspective,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.87,
          "end": 37.053,
          "en": "instead, we simply did not find the requested meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.19,
          "end": 40.44,
          "en": "So a better way of handling this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.44,
          "end": 44.91,
          "en": "would be to go here and check if not meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.91,
          "end": 48.69,
          "en": "So if meal is undefined, if we didn't find a meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.69,
          "end": 52.41,
          "en": "And then show the closest not-found page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.41,
          "end": 53.913,
          "en": "available in this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.9,
          "end": 57.09,
          "en": "And that can indeed be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.09,
          "end": 61.98,
          "en": "by calling a special function that's provided by NextJS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.98,
          "end": 64.2,
          "en": "the notFound function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.2,
          "end": 66.753,
          "en": "which is imported from next/navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.67,
          "end": 70.41,
          "en": "Calling this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.41,
          "end": 73.08,
          "en": "will stop this component from executing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.08,
          "end": 77.78999999999999,
          "en": "and will show the closest not-found or error page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.78999999999999,
          "end": 80.43,
          "en": "So if we have an error page that's closer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.43,
          "end": 83.85,
          "en": "as it's the case here, than the closest not-found page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.85,
          "end": 85.35300000000001,
          "en": "it will still show that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.34,
          "end": 87.53999999999999,
          "en": "But we can work around that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.53999999999999,
          "end": 90.72,
          "en": "by also adding a not-found tray as fall here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.72,
          "end": 92.75999999999999,
          "en": "instead of the meals folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.75999999999999,
          "end": 94.8,
          "en": "And then we can also set up some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.8,
          "end": 96.963,
          "en": "meal-specific not-found message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.83,
          "end": 100.44,
          "en": "Like Meal not found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.44,
          "end": 102.96000000000001,
          "en": "And then maybe say, \"Maybe we could not find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.96000000000001,
          "end": 107.703,
          "en": "the requested page or meal data,\" something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.86,
          "end": 111.50999999999999,
          "en": "And with that, if you now reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.50999999999999,
          "end": 114.42,
          "en": "you see that we get this not found page content here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.42,
          "end": 118.05,
          "en": "this meal-specific not-found page content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.05,
          "end": 121.383,
          "en": "And that's, of course, arguably a better user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
